Port of _patches/typescript/033-checker-expression-checked-callback.patch (tsc/internal/checker/checker.go) to tsrs.

- ExpressionCheckedCallback / RegisterExpressionCheckedCallback: tsrs_checker::ExpressionCheckedCallback (a plain
  fn pointer) and register_expression_checked_callback, next to check_expression_ex (checker_04.rs), re-exported
  from the crate root. check_expression_ex calls it with the node, the check mode and the result, after restoring
  the current node, as Go does.

tsrs-only: the callback lives in a OnceLock (a lock-free read on the hot path), so the first registration wins;
Go's later registrations replace the callback, and every Go registrant (etscheckerhooks' init, the typeparser test
init) registers the same function, typeparser.RecordCheckedExpressionType.

diff --git a/crates/tsrs_checker/src/checker_04.rs b/crates/tsrs_checker/src/checker_04.rs
